<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark Pfandbrief. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark Pfandbrief. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint leads BHF Bank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK HANNOVER</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    24.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.575    PAY DATE   S24.JAN.97</p>
<p>(Corrects ISS PRICE from 99.575.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.225     LISTING    HANN	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.6	 SELL CONC  0.165     DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 706</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
